index 0000000000..20f7afcbfd
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/dhcp-agent-pending-updates-8d2f6a1c3e5b7094.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    The DHCP agent now reports the number of network, subnet and port
+    updates waiting to be processed as ``pending_updates`` in its
+    ``configurations``, shown by ``openstack network agent show``, as the
+    L3 agent does. A value that stays high or keeps growing means the
+    agent is not keeping up with its work.
